sion":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694892","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5205270-1846651706691726","game_id":"steam-5205270","kind":"announcement","title":"Knight’s Party Joins Steam Next Fest! 🏰⚔️","summary":"Bring your pals together. Accept the chaos. Grab the crown!Knight's Party is participating in Steam Next Fest! Grab your fellow knights and dive into the medieval chaos our demo is currently online!⚔️ Compete in ridiculous, physics-driven minigames.🎮 Challenge your friends online or share the fun with split-screen local multiplayer.👑 Survive the chaos and fight for the tournament crown!Play the demo, share your feedback, and add the game to your wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:19:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691726","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5205270-1846651706690311","game_id":"steam-5205270","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog - What's Inside KNIGHT'S PARTY?","summary":"Hello, knights 👋Here's a real look at what you're receiving when you visit Knight's Party, since we've been working on the forge for months.In simply, it's a physics driven medieval party game in which two to four knights fight in a tournament of absurd minigames. Limbs dangle, bones shatter, and the winner is the one who best accepts the mayhem.🎮 Have Fun!One computer, one keyboard, and a stack of controllers make up a couch cooperative with split screen. You may enter by grabbing a gamepad and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:49:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690311","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5205270-1845383656397464","game_id":"steam-5205270","kind":"announcement","title":"Knight's Party Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Hi, knightsThe wait is over! The Knight's Party DEMO is now available on Steam!The kingdom has run out of knights, but someone still needs to take part in the royal tournaments. Put on your armor and join the competition!Discover Knight's PartyChallenge your friends in a series of fast-paced, chaotic tournament games:💣 Fire the cannons Take on your rivals and try to stay in the tournament.🍻 Pour the drinks Keep up with the chaos at the tavern.👑 Chase the crowns Outrun your rivals and claim the c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T19:49:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397464","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5205270-1843481262698430","game_id":"steam-5205270","kind":"announcement","title":"⚔️ Knight’s Party Is Coming to Steam","summary":"The kingdom ran out knights, but someone still had to participate royal tournaments. Knight's Party is a bunch of lethal tournament party games where everyone wants to become a knight yet nobody absolutely knows what they're doing. Take your friends, fire cannons, pour glasses, pursue crowns, and disintegrate to limb by limb. Here, survival is quite challenging. Challenge your friends in a series of quick fire events, each with its own venue, three line rules, and method of making you force to s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T22:03:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698430","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:50Z","discovery_method":"official_stea